    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A soft answer turneth away wrath: but grievous words stir up anger.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The tongue of the wise useth knowledge aright: but the mouth of fools poureth out foolishness.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The eyes of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.15.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.15.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.15.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.15.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in every place, beholding the evil and the good.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A wholesome tongue",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.15.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.15.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a tree of life: but perverseness therein",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.15.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.15.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a breach in the spirit.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A fool despiseth his father's instruction: but he that regardeth reproof is prudent.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In the house of the righteous",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.15.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.15.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "much treasure: but in the revenues of the wicked is trouble.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The lips of the wise disperse knowledge: but the heart of the foolish",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "doeth",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.15.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.15.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "not so.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sacrifice of the wicked",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.15.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.15.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "an abomination to the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.15.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.15.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ": but the prayer of the upright",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.15.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.15.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "his delight.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The way of the wicked",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.15.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.15.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "an abomination unto the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.15.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.15.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ": but he loveth him that followeth after righteousness.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Correction",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.15.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.15.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "grievous unto him that forsaketh the way:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.15.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.15.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he that hateth reproof shall die.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hell and destruction",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.15.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.15.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "before the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.15.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.15.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ": how much more then the hearts of the children of men?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A scorner loveth not one that reproveth him: neither will he go unto the wise.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A merry heart maketh a cheerful countenance: but by sorrow of the heart the spirit is broken.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The heart of him that hath understanding seeketh knowledge: but the mouth of fools feedeth on foolishness.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All the days of the afflicted",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.15.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.15.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "evil: but he that is of a merry heart",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "hath",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.15.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.15.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a continual feast.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.15.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Better",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.15.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.15.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "little with the fear of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.15.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.15.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "than great treasure and trouble therewith.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Better",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.15.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.15.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a dinner of herbs where love is, than a stalled ox and hatred therewith.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A wrathful man stirreth up strife: but",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
